$\because \cot \alpha=1, \quad \alpha \in\left(\pi, \frac{3 \pi}{2}\right)$ then$\tan \alpha=1$ and$\sec \beta=-\frac{5}{3}, \quad \beta \in\left(\frac{\pi}{2}, \pi\right)$ then$\tan \beta=-\frac{4}{3}$

